  "task": "I'm organizing a business dinner for 6 people next Thursday in Chicago with three potential restaurants: 'Alinea', 'Girl & the Goat', and 'Oriole'. First, check if I have any calendar conflicts that evening. Then compare these restaurants by their ratings, cuisine types, and opening hours around 7 PM. After selecting the best option, make a reservation and create a calendar event with the address and invite my colleagues (john@company.com, sarah@company.com)."
